/*
 * Implements semantic validation for trait declarations.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - validation of conditional declaration blocks inside traits,
 *   - compile-time evaluation of trait conditions,
 *   - declaration of inner trait members based on condition results,
 *   - validation of trait assertions,
 *   - construction of TraitRefType values,
 *   - prevention of repeated validation via isValidated flag.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::symbol::trait_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/symbol/trait_.yr
 * @Author(s):
